// CVEs that became Act now in the last hour: Act now in a Vulnder run that
// reached the table within the hour, and in no run in the two days before.
// Each CVE alerts once, at the first run that has it at Act now, however the
// rule's schedule lines up with the Logic App's. It goes by ingestion time,
// not TimeGenerated, so rows that arrive late are still counted, once.
// Runs hourly as the "Vulnder: new Act now CVE" analytics rule
// (workspace.bicep, with sentinelRules=true).
Vulnder_CL
| where TimeGenerated > ago(2d) and Priority == "act"
| extend Ingested = ingestion_time()
| summarize FirstAct = min(Ingested), arg_max(TimeGenerated, *) by Cve
| where FirstAct > ago(1h)
| project TimeGenerated, Cve, CveTitle, Priority, Reasons, Exploited, KevAddedAt, KevDueDate, KnownRansomware, SsvcExploitation, RespondWithinHours, Matched, FixedVersions, Mitigation, Advisory
